        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 6620, 5-1/2 Inch Center to Center Tuscany Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 10-1/8 Inch #16 Tuscany Sideplate Lockset has 5-1/2 inch mounting centers, perfect for many pre-drilled doors. This Tuscany Entry Set is made from Cast Bronze and is available in flat back and medium bronze finishes. Choose from a wide array of old world levers and knobs. This truly unique entryset comes packaged as a complete set including 2 plates and 2 interior trim knobs or levers. Choose from a locking single cylinder sideplate or a dummy set that neither latches or locks (usually used on French doors ).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Lost Wax Cast Bronze Tuscany Entry Door Sideplate Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass latch with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Tuscany Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 10-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and lever latch): <b>5-1/2\" Center to Center</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-5/8\" - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT06620-specifications.pdf?v=1704262423\"><b>Emtek 6620 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob/lever operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-6020-finish.jpg?v=1704354649\" width=\"394\" height=\"189\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 6020 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
